### Tachometers

The boat is equipped with two tachometers. The tachometer on the left is for the port engine. The one on the right is for the starboard engine.  The analog tachometers show the engine speed. The numbers on the meters show the engine speed  *1000 rpm (r/min).  1 Port tachometer 2 Starboard tachometer

